{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":674,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","holder-slug":"merr-the-storm","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"eloque","holder-quote":"“What are you going to do next, Merr? That is…surely you of all of us will have the easiest time. You don’t have to go with Pisces. You’re a [Bandit].”","id":"9b175e56-b2e7-5a9a-8ba2-f66c9730a96f"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":695,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"“No. No! If you weren’t a fellow [Slave] and I didn’t like you, fat man, I’d kick the crap out of you for that. That damned Maresar messed all of us up…she was a [Bandit] way back, before the new generation rolled in. So her class was [Bandit Lord] because there was no leadership! There are plenty of [Bandit Ladies]! Anyways, Maresar used to dress like a man. Everyone thought she was a [Bandit Lord]—word is she can even blend in with others thanks to her Skill. That’s why she got the class. I’m a [Bandit Lady]. Lady.”","id":"78fa9df1-53da-5d11-9bfd-981840858349"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":697,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","id":"37afb1d7-8719-51a4-9172-2a4f4aece753"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":706,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","holder-slug":"pisces-jealnet","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"“…Well, you can always learn to be a [Bandit]. Come to it, you’d be a fine addition to any gang, Pisces. What about it? Want to ride with the [Storm Bandits]? Merr’s Storm Bandits were a huge gang, and I could remake it again.”","id":"ea962c6a-0075-5042-8505-172219633c24"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":708,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","holder-slug":"merr-the-storm","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"“…That is, if I can figure out how the [Bandit]’s life goes. Now Roshal’s got a bounty on me, I can’t exactly ransom prisoners.”","id":"5e287b4c-41bb-56be-9431-3231e319c19b"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":732,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","holder-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"Merr tapped a finger to her lips. She was, somehow, the most ignorant save for perhaps Rophir, but a [Bandit] didn’t get regular scrying orb access. Which was strange because they were cheap, but Merr just waved that off.","id":"5bb63631-e679-5c89-9b85-45d83c2576b8"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":733,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","id":"e15cce97-2c43-5384-98ca-619a59c44a87"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":752,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","holder-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"His eyes roamed to the living horses plodding along. Merr instantly slapped his shoulder.","id":"80da8cfa-5765-558f-a6e8-1f42d1b73de8"}
