{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":1012,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","holder-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"Only eighteen people went with Merr. Which was surprising, given how competent the [Bandit Lady] was. But she intended to be a [Bandit] and…it just wasn’t in many.","id":"36c628c8-502a-574b-9b80-0fe699e999d6"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-38 H","paragraph":1304,"wording":"[Bandit]","event":"named","holder-slug":"merr-the-storm","holder-quote":"“Pisces. Merr is here to help. Isn’t she? She was a [Slave]. Just like us.”","id":"fbc138b5-7a1a-5c0a-89b0-77a98dd4b651"}
